license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Solar filament instance segmentation from GONG H-alpha images using
  a probability-map component tree, predicted strict-match quality,
  and disjoint instance selection by dynamic programming.
keywords:
  - solar filaments
  - instance segmentation
  - annotation disagreement
